						 <p>This was BRILLIANT! +1, +1 hard.</p> <p>I'm glad the SCP doesn't have a large container of sentient green and tan army men as well, we could have been looking at a miniature world war, and don't even get me started on what would have happened if we had gotten <a href="http://dentalxrad.ro/babes/imagini/all-mega-bloks-halo-sets-712.jpg">these guys</a> involved.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
